---
List, make and end keys.

Usage: ink key <COMMAND>

Commands
  list    The account's keys
  add     Make a key for another machine, such as a CI job
  revoke  End a key

Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log, --log-file
        (see `ink --help`)
More    ink key --help adds examples, notes and exit codes
